if {know_strix_name} == true:
	set {strix.name} = {strix.regular_name}
else:
	set {strix.name} = {strix.unknown_name}
join strix center
strix: [speed=5].....
strix: You didn't understand! [pause=0.2][b]THAT[/b] must be the issue!
strix: Right?... [pause=0.2]Of course it is! [pause=0.2]You wouldn't actually go [b][i]directly against[/i][/b] my orders!
strix: I just need to try again with my explanation!
audio -
strix: [shake rate=25.0 level=10 connected=1][b]WAIT.[n+] HERE.[/b][/shake]
leave strix
audio -
join strix center
strix: [wave amp=50 freq=5.0 connected=1][b]Perfect![/b][/wave] [pause=0.2]Where was I... [pause=0.2]right! [pause=0.2]My better, new and improved explanation!
strix: I know where I went wrong, [pause=0.2]I [wave amp=50 freq=5.0 connected=1]tricked you![/wave] [n+]I said the button did [b][shake rate=25.0 level=10 connected=1]bad things[/shake][/b], and the truth is...
strix: [b][shake rate=25.0 level=10 connected=1]It's trying to trick you![/shake][/b]
strix: It's actually trying to get you comfortable with it, without you realizing that you're playing the game [shake rate=25.0 level=10 connected=1]wrong.[/shake]
strix: [b][i]THEN[/i][/b], once you've gotten comfortable with it and [shake rate=25.0 level=10 connected=1]no longer believe me[/shake], then it's going to do [b][shake rate=25.0 level=10 connected=1]terrible things.[/shake][/b]
strix: [speed=5]...[speed][pause=0.2]<You don't believe me, do you?/You think I'm lying, don't you?>
strix: [font_size=15][i]I figur–[/i][/font_size] I mean...
strix: [b][shake rate=25.0 level=10 connected=1]How could you think that?[/shake][/b] [pause=0.2]I'm just trying to save you, [b]AND[/b] get you to play [b]MY[/b] game [font_size=15][i]instead of someone else's[/i][/font_size] at the same time!
strix: [i]But fine,[/i] I'll let you go for now and hopefully you'll see for yourself how good [b]MY[/b] game is, and not some random person's.
strix: [speed=0.5][b][i]AND[/i][/b] not get terrible things to happen to you![speed]
strix: Because that's my main goal! [n+][font_size=15][i]Obviously.[/i][/font_size]
strix: Y'know what, [pause=0.2]just wait for me to unfreeze this and play again!
strix: [font_size=15][i]And hopefully things will go better this time.[/i][/font_size][aa=0]
strix: [speed=0.5]Ok, bye![speed]
leave --All--
audio -